NAME: a store inside a condition
DESCRIPTION: (store x) in an EQ makes the SEQ's A-field x's place, labelled _LET1; found by the phase-1 review, see behtests/store_in_condition.beh
SRC:
(let (x 4)
  (seq
    (if (EQ (store x) 4)
      (NOP))
    (ADD 1 x) ))
EXPECTED:
;redcode-94b

_LET1 
  SEQ.AB #4     , #4     
  JMP    $_IF4  , #0     
  NOP    #0     , #0     
_IF4  
  ADD.A  #1     , $_LET1 
  DAT    #0     , #0     